{"data": [{"author_id": "1682144833953996801", "created_at": "2026-10-27T15:39:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115106024852005144"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "LiverEdit.Com", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://LiverEdit.Com", "start": 0, "unwound_url": "https://LiverEdit.Com", "url": "https://t.co/3usoZKy9MS"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/aYupCoBSFe", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Anony_si/status/2115106024852005144/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115106018543747072", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/aYupCoBSFe"}]}, "id": "2115106024852005144", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/3usoZKy9MS — Premium Biotech Domain Available\n\nThe liver is where gene editing is happening.\n\nOct 2026: First patient dosed in vivo prime editing (PM577a - Wilson disease)\nToday: Cellectis reports 90% liver editing (HEAL-101)\n\nMarket: Prime Editing $2.64B → $11.75B https://t.co/aYupCoBSFe", "url": "https://x.com/Anony_si/status/2115106024852005144"}, {"author_id": "2801692272", "created_at": "2026-10-27T19:23:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115162579265843222"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 24, "start": 19, "tag": "PRME"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/3y6QmRmczj", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LordHodler/status/2115162579265843222/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115162569656664064", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/3y6QmRmczj"}]}, "id": "2115162579265843222", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 684, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The FDA just wrote $PRME 's business model into draft regulation.\n\nNew guidance creates an \"Individualized Feature Space.\" Once a genome editing product is approved, you add new variants for other mutations in the same gene by supplement, on in vitro data. No new trial. Same LNP, https://t.co/3y6QmRmczj", "url": "https://x.com/LordHodler/status/2115162579265843222"}, {"author_id": "1464430347333083145", "created_at": "2026-10-27T02:49:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114912405411295521"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/RkBV7Ls8Cq", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Fintech03/status/2114912405411295521/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114910278181900288", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/RkBV7Ls8Cq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/RkBV7Ls8Cq", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Fintech03/status/2114912405411295521/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114910438425305088", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/RkBV7Ls8Cq"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/RkBV7Ls8Cq", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Fintech03/status/2114912405411295521/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114910470377447424", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/RkBV7Ls8Cq"}]}, "id": "2114912405411295521", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 3588, "like_count": 135, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 7, "retweet_count": 46}, "text": "A team in Cuttack has shown that an AI-designed enzyme can edit rice DNA in several different ways. They also regenerated edited plants and grew them to maturity.\n\nThe original enzyme came from Profluent Bio, an American company. The Indian work was adapting it for rice and https://t.co/RkBV7Ls8Cq", "url": "https://x.com/Fintech03/status/2114912405411295521"}, {"article": {"title": "Gene Editing, Part Two "}, "author_id": "1778820687156703232", "created_at": "2026-10-26T02:02:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114538007697260967"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2114…", "end": 23, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114532498546085888", "start": 0, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2114532498546085888", "url": "https://t.co/tjmM1rymKV"}]}, "id": "2114538007697260967", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 122, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/tjmM1rymKV", "url": "https://x.com/synbiomatica/status/2114538007697260967"}, {"author_id": "1523638440503300096", "created_at": "2026-10-27T01:55:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114898626866507969"], "id": "2114898626866507969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 82, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Prime Medicine has dosed the first patient with an in-body prime-editing therapy for Wilson disease — a one-time infusion that carries the editor to liver cells to fix the ATP7B mutation behind copper buildup. Nature calls it the first known use of prime editing directly inside a", "url": "https://x.com/Deep___White/status/2114898626866507969"}, {"author_id": "2457454550", "created_at": "2026-10-26T19:16:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114798416178143548"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 81, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20", "url": "https://t.co/Xu3ydjKB8y"}]}, "id": "2114798416178143548", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing al