17306", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2114204011809439839", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body | Nature https://t.co/WdR8pyMesd https://t.co/W8iM3m8GWH", "url": "https://x.com/SeektheDamned/status/2114865424966017306"}, {"author_id": "1704994660374970369", "created_at": "2026-10-25T22:39:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114487045917638877"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/oxfUCk7tbu", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/DrAlexEhsan/status/2114487045917638877/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114487002544381952", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/oxfUCk7tbu"}]}, "id": "2114487045917638877", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 578, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "SCIENTISTS HAVE BEGUN REWRITING HUMAN DNA INSIDE THE BODY!\n\nWhat if we could correct the genetic mistake responsible for a disease instead of treating its consequences for a lifetime?\n\nThis is no longer purely theoretical!\n\nNature reported a remarkable milestone in October 2026! https://t.co/oxfUCk7tbu", "url": "https://x.com/DrAlexEhsan/status/2114487045917638877"}, {"author_id": "14687475", "created_at": "2026-10-26T10:40:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114668471791587404"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 81, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20", "url": "https://t.co/AgFBba3Lp2"}]}, "id": "2114668471791587404", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body https://t.co/AgFBba3Lp2", "url": "https://x.com/Emma_MacLennan/status/2114668471791587404"}, {"author_id": "21558596", "created_at": "2026-10-27T10:36:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115029774309405166"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Great to hear that prime editing has advanced to the clinic! Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/a…", "end": 104, "expanded_url": "https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/a-first-for-crispr-powerful-prime-editing-alters-dna-directly-in-the-human-body", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115029774628261888/IU6u7CZK?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2115029774628261888/IU6u7CZK?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 81, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body – Lifeboat News: The Blog", "unwound_url": "https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/a-first-for-crispr-powerful-prime-editing-alters-dna-directly-in-the-human-body", "url": "https://t.co/JgGIKRO3dz"}]}, "id": "2115029774309405166", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 132, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body https://t.co/JgGIKRO3dz", "url": "https://x.com/LifeboatHQ/status/2115029774309405166"}, {"author_id": "414246519", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:44:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114775159303287061"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 14, "start": 0, "tag": "العلاج_الجيني"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/uVoEoh6znr", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/DrAbdulmajeedFR/status/2114775159303287061/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114775151573151744", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/uVoEoh6znr"}]}, "id": "2114775159303287061", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 1996, "like_count": 29, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 9}, "text": "#العلاج_الجيني مستمر في التوسع و التطور 🧬\n\nفي بحث سابق اكتشفنا احدى المتغيرات الجينية المرتبطة بجين ATP7B و التي لها ارتباط بمرض ويلسون هو اضطراب وراثي نادر و  يحدث نتيجة طفرة في جين (ATP7B)، مما يمنع الكبد من التخلص من النحاس الزائد، فيتراكم بنسب سامة في الكبد والدماغ والعينين. https://t.co/uVoEoh6znr", "url": "https://x.com/DrAbdulmajeedFR/status/2114775159303287061"}, {"author_id": "1359741318008889344", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:08:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114766059018281118"], "id": "2114766059018281118", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Is it me, or is this the science story of the month? Prime editing, the search-and-replace version of CRISPR, has just been used to rewrite DNA inside a living person for the first time.", "url": "https://x.com/KTrifonov/status/2114766059018281118"}, {"author_id": "1543098519854145536", "created_at": "2026-10-26T17:18:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114768631292940512"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Nature - Application of the high-precision technique is part of a clinical trial to treat a genetic disease that can cause liver and nerve damage.", "display_url": "nature.com/articles/d4158…", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x", "images": [{"height": 600, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1066}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2113359869277593601/9vi5mD1x?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 257, "status": 200, "title": "A first for CRISPR: powerful prime editing alters DNA directly in the human body", "unwound_url": "https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-03371-x?error=cookies_not_supported&code=943859e7-67e1-482b-be5d-3371b22dab20", "url": "https://t.co/LmBa7Vzbps"}]}, "id": "2114768631292940512", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "La edición genética acaba de dar otro salto:ya se prueba “prime editing” directamente dentro del cuerpo humano para corregir mutaciones.A diferencia del CRISPR clásico,puede reescribir fragmentos específicos de ADN sin cortar necesariamente sus dos cadenas.https://t.co/LmBa7Vzbps", "url": "https://x.com/mareguer/status/2114768631292940512"}, {"author_id": "2016491161033064448", "created_at": "2026-10-27T19:52:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115169728666710458"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 5, "start": 0, "tag": "PRME"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/ladivanicotian…", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/ladivanicotiana/status/2115134969261539809", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/n2ha23X92t"}]}, "id": "2115169728666710458", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 786, "like_count": 25, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115134969261539809", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "$PRME | FDA proposes adding new gene variants to an approved editing BLA without new clinical trials 🚨\n\nOn October 27, 2026, FDA's Center for Biologics Evaluation and Research issued a draft guidance, \"Individualized Human Genome Editing Products: Considerations for BLA https://t.co/n2ha23X92t", "url": "https://x.com/TheFoxRadar/status/2115169728666710458"}, {"author_id": "1796007822812946432", "created_at": "2026-10-27T16:52:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115124482524217724"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/Tu7xjfopwK", "end": 169, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/geraldblue75/status/2115124482524217724/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115124476140556288", "start": 146, "url": "https://t.co/Tu7xjfopwK"}]}, "id": "2115124482524217724", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Unlike traditional CRISPR-Cas9 (which typically cuts both strands of DNA or disables genes), prime editing acts like a \"search-and-replace\" tool. https://t.co/Tu7xjfopwK", "url": "https://x.com/geraldblue75/status/2115124482524217724"}, {"author_id": "1876497946755092480", "created_at": "2026-10-26T12:39:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114698362209403037"], "id": "2114698362209403037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Scientists just used prime editing, a more precise form of CRISPR, inside a living human for the first time.\n\nThe target is Wilson disease, a genetic fault that lets copper damage the liver and brain.\n\nOne patient has been dosed. Whether the DNA rewrite works is still unknown.", "url": "https://x.com/Vadim_Bioniq/status/2114698362209403037"}, {"author_id": "2074383955852500992", "created_at": "2026-10-26T08:10:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114630838017229242"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 279, "start": 267, "tag": "GeneEditing"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/rcCqeEJHXI", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/WisdomAcaPress/status/2114630838017229242/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114630826709368832", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/rcCqeEJHXI"}]}, "id": "2114630838017229242", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "For the first time, DNA has been edited directly inside a human body. 🧬Prime Medicine used prime editing — a “search-and-replace” tool more precise than CRISPR — to correct a Wilson’s disease mutation in liver cells.\nOne IV dose. No cell extraction. First data: 2027.#GeneEditing https://t.co/rcCqeEJHXI", "url": "https://x.com/WisdomAcaPress/status/2114630838017229242"}, {"author_id": "1750768423548903424", "created_at": "2026-10-27T16:47:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115123272157466625"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/W8cYp00jl3", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/factswithstatsX/status/2115123272157466625/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2115123260899954690", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/W8cYp00jl3"}]}, "id": "2115123272157466625", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 BREAKING: Scientists Have Rewritten DNA Inside a Human Body for the First Time!\n\nIn a major breakthrough, Prime Medicine has administered an experimental prime-editing therapy directly into a human patient — potentially opening a new chapter in genetic medicine.\n\n🧬 The https://t.co/W8cYp00jl3", "url": "https://x.com/factswithstatsX/status/2115123272157466625"}, {"author_id": "2060252048965451776", "created_at": "2026-10-26T05:09:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2114585160259625215"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/g5LnKDy5kd", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/exfilnews/status/2114585160259625215/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2114585157940236288", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/g5LnKDy5kd"}]}, "id": "2114585160259625215", "